### Priorities API v1. Every request needs the access token from the sign in request below.
### Select the "local" environment (http/http-client.env.json).

### Sign in (put login and password in http/http-client.private.env.json, which is git-ignored)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "{{login}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### List priorities (ordered by rank; cost is added to the order total)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/priorities
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Without a token returns 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/priorities
Accept: application/json
